WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.490
Built around your drawer. A source-led assembly concept • E900BP

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.490
Every part has a purpose. The bottom has three through holes. The 7000 fasteners are installed later.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.490
Align. Insert. Engage. Align all connections together before seating the frame.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.490
Slide the bottom into its grooves. Slide beneath the rear panel with all three through holes empty.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.490
Secure the bottom to the back. Three 7000 back-panel fasteners pass through the bottom into the rear panel.

6
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.490
Ready for the next connection. Explore this drawer style with Lockdowel.
